WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.155
Several years went by.

2
00:00:10.156 --> 00:00:14.910
Rapunzel missed her parents more than ever.

3
00:00:14.911 --> 00:00:18.299
She still wrote letters to them.

4
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.924
Dear Mama and Papa,

5
00:00:20.925 --> 00:00:24.465
It's very boring in this tower.

6
00:00:24.466 --> 00:00:26.719
I brush my hair.

7
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.969
I read the magic book.

8
00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:34.869
I mix lots of potions.

9
00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.857
Some are for the witch.

10
00:00:36.858 --> 00:00:39.246
Some are for me.

11
00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:42.208
I keep mixing the echo potion.

12
00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:44.700
But it never works.

13
00:00:44.701 --> 00:00:48.756
I tried the changing potion again last week too.

14
00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:54.318
" Skipti, breyt, vera ," I

15
00:00:54.319 --> 00:01:01.693
said. Then I poured the potion on

16
00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:07.977
Prickle. It just made him smell

17
00:01:07.978 --> 00:01:12.235
bad! I look out the window a

18
00:01:12.236 --> 00:01:17.471
lot. I like to watch the prince at the

19
00:01:17.472 --> 00:01:19.721
palace. I feel like I know

20
00:01:19.722 --> 00:01:23.965
him. But, of course, I never met a

21
00:01:23.966 --> 00:01:26.759
prince! He often walks in the

22
00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:30.130
forest. He is searching for

23
00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:33.393
something. I wonder what it

24
00:01:33.394 --> 00:01:36.380
is! The witch heard me singing the other

25
00:01:36.381 --> 00:01:39.455
day. She got so

26
00:01:39.456 --> 00:01:42.836
mad! I think I know why she gets

27
00:01:42.837 --> 00:01:45.485
upset. She is very

28
00:01:45.486 --> 00:01:49.254
lonely. So today I made up a song just for

29
00:01:49.255 --> 00:01:51.570
her. It made her so

30
00:01:51.571 --> 00:01:55.031
happy! And suddenly I felt

31
00:01:55.032 --> 00:01:58.356
brave. I asked her when she would let me

32
00:01:58.357 --> 00:02:02.167
go. "Never!" the witch

33
00:02:02.168 --> 00:02:04.470
yelled. But then she surprised

34
00:02:04.471 --> 00:02:11.435
me. She said, "When you're

35
00:02:11.436 --> 00:02:14.862
18." I can return home when I'm

36
00:02:14.863 --> 00:02:17.323
18! And here is more good news.

37
00:02:17.324 --> 00:02:20.459
I mixed the changing potion again this morning.

38
00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:33.931
This time I sang the words.

39
00:02:33.932 --> 00:02:37.218
The potion turned bright gold.

40
00:02:37.219 --> 00:02:40.577
I poured it on Prickle.

41
00:02:40.578 --> 00:02:49.830
Poof! He turned back into a bird!

42
00:02:49.831 --> 00:02:53.387
Prickle flew away into the woods.

43
00:02:53.388 --> 00:02:57.068
I was worried he was gone forever.

44
00:02:57.069 --> 00:02:59.839
But he came back!

45
00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:03.772
He brought me a ripe red strawberry!

46
00:03:03.773 --> 00:03:07.813
Someday the echo potion will work too.

47
00:03:07.814 --> 00:03:09.547
Your daughter forever,

48
00:03:09.548 --> 00:03:17.971
Rapunzel

